<title>SWEDEN: MERRILL SEES NOKIA '97 EPS AT FIM 16.70.</title>
<headline>MERRILL SEES NOKIA '97 EPS AT FIM 16.70.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. investment bank Merrill Lynch has raised its forecast for Finnish telecoms group Nokia Oy's full-year 1997 EPS to 16.70 markka from an earlier 15.50 markka forecast, sources who had read a new Merrill Lynch report told Reuters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch also raised its full-year 1998 EPS forecast for Nokia to 20.70 markka from 18 markka. The bank saw average annual growth of 23 percent for Nokia over the coming five years.</p>
<p>In 1996, Nokia's EPS was 10.73 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
